# Deliberately empty.
#
# Official character cards are no longer shipped as binaries in this repo —
# they live in the Yuralume Cloud catalog and every deployment reads them
# from there (OFFICIAL_CARD_CLOUD_CATALOG_PLAN D1/D5).
#
# The directory stays because the local pack mechanism does: drop your own
# `.lumecard` files here (or point CHARACTER_CARD_PACK_DIR at a folder
# outside the image) and they appear in the card gallery alongside — or,
# with the catalog switched off, instead of — the official ones. That is the
# air-gapped path, and it needs no network at all.
